am found a data-integrity issue during validation. The team found that some records were not properly formatted and could not be included in the export. We are currently investigating the root cause and working to fix the timeline for the feature release. Customers should expect the feature to be available again in approximately one week from today, and we will provide a follow-up update once the issue is resolved. For urgent support cases, our support team will prioritize your request and work with you to find a temporary workaround if needed. Thank you for your patience and understanding.\n\nSincerely,\n\nYour Company Name\"\"\"\n\nThe above draft contains multiple copies of the same content and has some errors (e<think>The user wants me to draft a customer-facing",
